n開店造訪的多年後終於再來試試\n肉片依舊薄如火鍋刷肉\n麵量是小鳥胃的大小 男生可能要再加2球麵才夠\n湯頭也保持原來的順口好味\n依舊是想吃拉麵的鄰家選擇\n\n2022\n東湖新開幕的拉麵小館，招牌豚骨蒜味湯頭濃稠適宜，肉片偏薄但炙燒香，細麵還不夠Q彈，配菜有筍乾還有龍鬚菜，還行。明太子叉燒飯份量稍嫌少，是用心經營的鄰家麵店，店內乾淨座位多以吧台為主 ，四口之家要等一下。",null,[0,33]]]],[null,1664699375000000,1664699375000000,"3 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQUFWSkZDUUkwZU5rY01nYUFBUktPUQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfQUFWSkZDUUkwZU5rY01nYUFBUktPURoTQ2d3STc1ZmxtUVlRd05uZXFBTQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjzx_Cn-NmWAxU7dvUHHYlWPCUQ_2MI1wEoCw"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1622216000888302996/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjFlbkp4TW5kM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1622216000888302996/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjFlbkp4TW5kM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1622216000888302996/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjFlbkp4TW5kM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1622216000888302996/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjFlbkp4TW5kM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1622216000888302996/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjFlbkp4TW5kM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1622216000888302996/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjFlbkp4TW5kM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝你的喜歡，讓拉麵美味是我們的使命，你的鼓勵是我們店繼續努力的動力，繼續鼓勵不要停哦~",null,[0,44]]]],[null,null,2903,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR1enJxMnd3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x71cd0ab6bd7a0b6a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDuzrq2wwE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR1enJxMnd3RRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR1enJxMnd3RRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR1enJxMkl3EhNDZ3dJeGVXc3V3WVFnTVR